{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And the nakedness of your mother's sister, etc.</b> Scripture repeated the warning concerning them, to say that one is warned concerning them both regarding his father's and mother's sisters from the father's side and regarding their sisters from the mother's side — but the nakedness of the wife of his father's brother was prohibited only regarding the wife of his father's brother from the father's side (cf. Yevamot 54)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:26.003911024Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}